+# A steward merges a grade into another: everyone on the merged grade today is given the other, in list order.
+# Refused (400, nothing written) for anyone else or the same grade twice. Responds with how many moved, and the people.
+merge:
+  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.person.MergeGrade
+  govern: [ transaction ]
